Z||000007||RossT||08-10-2001||11:50 AM||||Thanks cheev..<P>Check out <A HREF="http://www.ls1.com" TARGET=_blank>www.ls1.com</A>   click on forums then show car detailing.  Find posts from a guy named "keven"  He is a zaino dist. He will take a credit card or paypal and will ship out the same day.  If you call zainobros from their web site it will take about 4 days to get your order.  Zaino is about to release a new product that speeds up the drying time and also alows you to put on additional layers faster.  It might be worth your time to wait for its release.  Make sure you read everything about zaino before you apply.  Most people use way to much the first time.  I would also adivice to use their clay bar system the first time.<P>Good luck.||||reg||1
